}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "vendor_id": "VD-SOLAR-SURAT-001",
  "company_name": "Solar Solutions Surat",
  "owner_name": "Amit Patel",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "email": "vendor@example.com",
  "city": "Surat",
  "service_type": "Solar",
