## 🔒 Authentication Flow

### For Vendors:
1. Register via `/api/vendors/register`
2. Login via `/api/auth/login` to get token
3. Use token in `Authorization: Bearer {token}` header
4. Token expires in 7 days (configurable)

### For Admin:
1. Use default credentials (set in `.env`)
2. Login via `/api/auth/login`
3. Receive token with admin role
4. Access admin-only endpoints

