## 🎯 Common Use Cases

### Case 1: Customer Submits Lead
```
1. POST /api/leads/ (with lead data)
2. System generates LD-SOLAR-SURAT-27202512-001
3. System finds matching vendors (city + service + active + credits > 0)
4. System creates assignments with vendor-specific IDs
5. System sends notifications
6. System deducts 1 credit per vendor
```

### Case 2: Vendor Purchases Credits
```
1. POST /api/vendors/buy-credits (credits: 50)
2. System creates payment record
3. System generates Razorpay payment link
4. Vendor completes payment
5. Razorpay sends webhook
6. System verifies payment
7. System adds 50 credits
8. System activates vendor
9. System generates invoice
```

### Case 3: Admin Monitors System
```
1. GET /api/admin/dashboard (get overview)
2. GET /api/admin/vendors (view all vendors)
3. PUT /api/admin/vendors/1/credits?credits=10 (add credits)
4. GET /api/admin/lead-assignments (view routing logs)
```

---

## 📝 Notes

- All dates are system-generated (UTC)
- All IDs are automatically generated
- Duplicate detection uses name + mobile combination
- 1 Credit = 1 Lead = ₹100 (configurable)
- Vendors see sequential lead numbers only
- System maintains internal lead IDs for tracking
- Email notifications sent for each lead assignment
- Payment webhook verifies and updates credits automatically

